<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Is the RT84 the same hardware as the RT3S? <br>There appear to be some similarities in the look and feel.</div></blockquote>No.<br><br>Only works with RT-3S aka MD TYT-UV380<br><br>TYT aka Retevis make loads of radios which use the same case and display etc, but are completely different when you open them and look at the hardware<br><br>Same applies to the new Baofeng DM-1801, which looks idential to last year's DM-1801, including the firmware which looks identical, but they completely replaced all the internal hardware with different CPU and DMR chips, hence the new DM-1801 is no longer compatible.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Mon Sep 26, 2022 11:20 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
